Output docs/assets/clips/routines.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1200
Set Height 750
Set Padding 12
Set Framerate 12
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Set CursorBlink false

Hide
Type `exec "$KDEMO_DIR/env.sh" herdr`
Enter
Sleep 4s
Ctrl+B
Type "b"
Sleep 300ms
Ctrl+B
Type "h"
Sleep 500ms
Type "h"
Sleep 800ms
Show

# The Routines page offers three to start from.
Sleep 1.2s
Type "3"
Sleep 2.5s

# A health check: what it does, the repo, when, what it may do, its name.
Enter
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "shop"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Enter
Sleep 2.5s

# The table it adds to config.toml, written on y.
Type "y"
Sleep 4s
